di language support","comments":47,"created_at":"2014-04-17T13:38:25Z"},{"number":1496,"title":":! (bang) and system() are not interactive","comments":43,"created_at":"2014-11-19T18:32:20Z"},{"number":25377,"title":"UI flush/redraw can happen before UI attach / UIEnter","comments":42,"created_at":"2023-09-26T22:00:17Z"},{"number":31506,"title":"`executable()` is slow on WSL","comments":38,"created_at":"2024-12-08T01:24:44Z"},{"number":39893,"title":"rename `al` text-object and add a better pair for `il`","comments":37,"created_at":"2026-05-19T17:59:43Z"},{"number":21629,"title":"add :Hardcopy command","comments":37,"created_at":"2023-01-03T11:25:58Z"}],"discussions":[{"number":42798,"title":"\"gO\" for viewing the table of content of an help page is not readable","comments":3,"category":"Q&A","created_at":"2026-11-11T05:55:04Z"},{"number":42795,"title":"Swara: LilyPond support with its own Tree-sitter grammar and a Rust language server","comments":0,"category":"Show and tell","created_at":"2026-11-11T04:17:00Z"},{"number":42794,"title":"Can you completely stop neovim 0.12 interfering with LSP completion options?","comments":3,"category":"General","created_at":"2026-11-11T03:55:41Z"},{"number":42782,"title":"How do you instruct Neovim 0.12 autocomplete to use raw lsp completions?","comments":5,"category":"General","created_at":"2026-11-10T05:33:48Z"},{"number":42780,"title":"How do you manually trigger auto complete in neovim 0.12?","comments":2,"category":"General","created_at":"2026-11-10T02:29:22Z"},{"number":42719,"title":"Getting Started with Neovim Contributions and Preparing for GSoC 2027","comments":1,"category":"Q&A","created_at":"2026-11-06T06:37:18Z"},{"number":42575,"title":"Please add btmux to the \"GUI\" section of the Related Projects wiki","comments":0,"category":"General","created_at":"2026-10-28T07:30:36Z"},{"number":42543,"title":"neovim conf 2027","comments":0,"category":"General","created_at":"2026-10-25T21:45:13Z"}],"latest_release":{"name":"Nvim 0.12.6","tag":"v0.12.6","published_at":"2026-10-09T15:43:25Z","body":"```\r\nNVIM v0.12.6\r\nBuild type: Release\r\nLuaJIT 2.1.1774638290\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Release notes\r\n\r\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/commit/779c36969e31080503be2dfccbcc3f999e289606) (fixes + features)\r\n- [News](./runtime/doc/news.txt) (`:help news` in Nvim)\r\n\r\n## Install\r\n\r\n### Windows\r\n\r\n#### Zip\r\n\r\n1. Download **nvim-win64.zip** (or **nvim-win-arm64.zip** for ARM)\r\n2. Extract the zip\r\n3. Run `nvim.exe` in your terminal\r\n\r\n#### MSI\r\n\r\n1. Download **nvim-win64.msi** (or **nvim-win-arm64.msi** for ARM)\r\n2. Run the MSI\r\n3. Run `nvim.exe` in your terminal\r\n\r\nNote: On Windows \"Server\" you may need to [install `vcruntime*.dll`](https://neovim.io/doc/install/#windows).\r\n\r\n### macOS (x86_64)\r\n\r\n1. Download **nvim-macos-x86_64.tar.gz**\r\n2. Run `xattr -c ./nvim-macos-x86_64.tar.gz` (to avoid \"unknown developer\" warning)\r\n3. Extract: `tar xzvf nvim-macos-x86_64.tar.gz`\r\n4. Run `./nvim-macos-x86_64/bin/nvim`\r\n\r\n### macOS (arm64)\r\n\r\n1. Download **nvim-macos-arm64.tar.gz**\r\n2. Run `xattr -c ./nvim-macos-arm64.tar.gz` (to avoid \"unknown developer\" warning)\r\n3. Extract: `tar xzvf nvim-macos-arm64.tar.gz`\r\n4. Run `./nvim-macos-arm64/bin/nvim`\r\n\r\n### Linux (x86_64)\r\n\r\nIf your system does not have the required glibc version, try the (unsupported) [builds for older glibc](https://github.com/neovim/neovim-releases).\r\n\r\n#### AppImage\r\n\r\n1. Download **nvim-linux-x86_64.appimage**\r\n2. Run `chmod u+x nvim-linux-x86_64.appimage && ./nvim-linux-x86_64.appimage`\r\n   - If your system does not have FUSE you can [extract the appimage](https://github.com/AppImage/AppImageKit/wiki/FUSE#type-2-appimage):\r\n     ```bash\r\n     ./nvim-linux-x86_64.appimage --appimage-extract\r\n     ./squashfs-root/usr/bin/nvim\r\n     ```\r\n\r\n#### Tarball\r\n\r\n1. Download **nvim-linux-x86_64.tar.gz**\r\n2. Extract: `tar xzvf nvim-linux-x86_64.tar.gz`\r\n3. Run `./nvim-linux-x86_64/bin/nvim`\r\n\r\n### Linux (arm64)\r\n\r\n#### AppImage\r\n\r\n1. Download **nvim-linux-arm64.appimage**\r\n2. Run `chmod u+x nvim-linux-arm64.appimage && ./nvim-linux-arm64.appimage`\r\n   - If your system does not have FUSE you can [extract the appimage](https://github.com/AppImage/AppImageKit/wiki/FUSE#type-2-appimage):\r\n     ```bash\r\n     ./nvim-linux-arm64.appimage --appimage-extract\r\n     ./squashfs-root/usr/bin/nvim\r\n     ```\r\n\r\n#### Tarball\r\n\r\n1. Download **nvim-linux-arm64.tar.gz**\r\n2. Extract: `tar xzvf nvim-linux-arm64.tar.gz`\r\n3. Run `./nvim-linux-arm64/bin/nvim`\r\n\r\n### Other\r\n\r\n- Install by [package manager](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/master/INSTALL.md#install-from-package)\r\n","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[{"title":"Neovim","url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim","hn":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=7278214","source":"Hacker News","lang":"en","date":"2014-02-21","points":879,"comments":362},{"title":"Neovim v0.5","url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/releases/tag/v0.5.0","hn":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=27713358","source":"Hacker News","lang":"en","date":"2021-07-02","points":449,"comments":208},{"title":"Neovim 0.12.0","url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/releases/tag/v0.12.0","hn":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47565316","source":"Hacker News","lang":"en","date":"2026-03-29","points":409,"comments":262},{"title":"Neovim 0.7 Released","url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/releases/tag/v0.7.0","hn":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=31039569","source":"Hacker News","lang":"en","date":"2022-04-15","points":336,"comments":216},{"title":"Neovim v0.4.0","url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/commit/e2cc5fe09d98ce1ccaaa666a835c896805ccc196","hn":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=20981363","source":"Hacker News","lang":"en","date":"2019-09-16","points":334,"comments":162},{"title":"Neovim 0.8 Re